1
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,336
=Episode 6=

2
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:35,839
You're awake.

3
00:00:35,839 --> 00:00:36,679
Jin Yunlie.

4
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:41,439
You have a nice smile.

5
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,880
Well...

6
00:00:50,039 --> 00:00:50,840
Xi Yuan.

7
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:53,920
Ever since we met,

8
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,320
I haven't treated you very well.

9
00:00:57,159 --> 00:00:58,520
Why did you risk your life to save me?

10
00:00:59,000 --> 00:00:59,600
Uh...

11
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:00,439
Well...

12
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:02,600
I got worried when I saw you in danger.

13
00:01:03,439 --> 00:01:04,240
Worried?

14
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:08,000
(If you die, my mission fails.)

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,280
(But I can't exactly tell him that.)

16
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,719
Tell me the truth.

17
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,079
Did you put so much effort

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,799
into the Martial Trial
just to become the Crown Princess?

19
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,359
Yes.

20
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,920
I already told you.

21
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:26,000
I want to be the Crown Princess.

22
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:26,760
Your Highness.

23
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,519
I had a difficult childhood.

24
00:01:28,799 --> 00:01:30,719
I often suffered hunger, cold,
and mistreatment.

25
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,840
I never want to live like that again.

26
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,879
Being Crown Princess would be great.

27
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,519
I'd have food, fine clothes,

28
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,959
and never go hungry or cold again.

29
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:02,040
Where is your home?

30
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,439
I can send you back.

31
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,920
My hometown?

32
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,599
It's very, very far away.

33
00:02:13,799 --> 00:02:17,120
I probably can't return in this life.

34
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,199
Then how did you get here?

35
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,000
I can't really explain it.

36
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:25,599
I don't even know why I was chosen.

37
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:28,039
In the blink of an eye,

38
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,560
and everything was different.

39
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:34,080
(She really did lose her memory.)

40
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,319
(Never mind.)

41
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,680
Don't dwell

42
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,240
on the past.

43
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:42,199
Whoever you once were,

44
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:45,039
stay in Huyun and make a life here.

45
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,719
That's wonderful!

46
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:50,039
Then I'll fulfill my duties
as the Crown Princess.

47
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:52,080
I'll stand by your side,

48
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,240
treat you with respect,

49
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,240
and live in harmony with you.

50
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,039
You...

51
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,919
get some rest.

52
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,000
I'll see you another day.

53
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,240
Your Highness.

54
00:03:04,479 --> 00:03:06,000
Let's set our wedding date

55
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,840
right now.

56
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,400
Xi Yuan.

57
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,039
You won the Martial Trial

58
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:15,159
and saved my life.

59
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,759
The title of Crown Princess
belongs to you.

60
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,800
Mm.

61
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:23,319
But if all you want
is a secure livelihood,

62
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:24,879
I can find you

63
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:26,000
some post in Huyun.

64
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,400
Chief Chamberlain.

65
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:31,199
You'll have enough food and warm clothes

66
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:32,240
and never want for anything.

67
00:03:32,439 --> 00:03:33,919
You won't even serve me personally.

68
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,199
What do you think?

69
00:03:36,919 --> 00:03:37,719
What?

70
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,240
Jin Yunlie, I won

71
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,719
the Crown Princess title fairly.

72
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,840
You have to keep your promise!

73
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:45,719
I just feel that...

74
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:47,840
we don't have feelings
for each other now,

75
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:51,439
it's unfair to ask you
to marry me like this.

76
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:53,840
It wouldn't be!

77
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,439
Haven't I already

78
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,800
told you how I feel?

79
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:59,199
How can you not see how I feel?

80
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:04,280
All right.

81
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,560
Then pinky promise.

82
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,719
It's a deal.

83
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:24,208
(Huangyan Kingdom)

84
00:04:27,980 --> 00:04:34,016
(Chi Li, King of Huangyan)

85
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,439
(This Spiritual Art fluctuation...)

86
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:37,680
(It's her.)

87
00:04:42,319 --> 00:04:43,120
So...

88
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,879
you're still alive.

89
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,000
Shisi.

90
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,480
Why do you always show up
out of nowhere?

91
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,120
Congratulations.

92
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:07,040
You're about to become
Huyun's Crown Princess.

93
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,160
Mm.

94
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,480
What is it?

95
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,920
Is something bothering you?

96
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:17,839
No.

97
00:05:18,399 --> 00:05:19,920
You completed the mission.

98
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,040
I'm happy for you.

99
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:22,959
That's true.

100
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:25,600
I almost died,

101
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,439
but at least everything worked out.

102
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,279
Then...

103
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,639
do you really have feelings for him?

104
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:36,040
You mean Jin Yunlie?

105
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,120
No way.

106
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:39,319
My type is Zhao Yibo,

107
00:05:39,319 --> 00:05:40,360
not someone like him.

108
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:49,920
What's wrong?

109
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,720
Nothing.

110
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,319
Focus.

111
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,040
Okay.

112
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:02,800
Xi Yuan.

113
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,000
Don't be consumed by your inner demon.

114
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:08,959
Follow me.

115
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,439
It's a deal.

116
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:20,319
Though someone like him isn't so bad.

117
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:41,920
(Xi Yuan.)

118
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,680
(Why did you...)

119
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:45,680
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

120
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,120
Everything's been taken care of.

121
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,480
Your Highness,

122
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,639
the area has been cleared.

123
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,360
All demon spirits possessing the people

124
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,279
have been purged.

125
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,240
Good.

126
00:06:55,399 --> 00:06:56,639
If demon spirits got into Huyun,

127
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,040
it would be a disaster.

128
00:06:59,199 --> 00:07:01,199
You handled this well.

129
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,000
Your Highness.

130
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,720
Miss Xi Yuan won the Martial Trial.

131
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:09,160
Will you really make her Crown Princess?

132
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,560
What is it?

133
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:13,720
Huangyan has long been our enemy.

134
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,319
Making her Crown Princess

135
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,279
is a serious matter.

136
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,600
Please reconsider, Your Highness.

137
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,240
Come on.

138
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,839
They're both talented and attractive.

139
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,199
I think they're a perfect match.

140
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:23,560
Besides, Miss Xi Yuan

141
00:07:23,759 --> 00:07:25,399
saved you more than once.

142
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,639
She clearly has feelings for you.

143
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,000
I was wrong.

144
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,439
Please calm down, Father.

145
00:07:43,639 --> 00:07:44,519
Wrong?

146
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,759
You intend to make a woman
of Huangyan's royal family

147
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:50,879
the Crown Princess of Huyun?

148
00:07:51,199 --> 00:07:52,240
I never realized

149
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,800
you had acquired such nerve.

150
00:07:57,879 --> 00:08:00,879
Xi Yuan helped me capture
Chancellor Xia and his daughter.

151
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:02,600
You never truly know someone's heart.

152
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,720
Yunlie, remember this.

153
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,519
Those not of our people

154
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,240
can never be trusted.

155
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:10,439
The Xuanji Jade is at stake.

156
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:12,199
I will never allow

157
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,040
Huyun's Crown Princess

158
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:15,319
to come from another kingdom.

159
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,399
Father.

160
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:17,000
Enough.

161
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:18,759
There is nothing more to discuss.

162
00:08:19,079 --> 00:08:19,680
Father.

163
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:22,439
Her life is in your hands.

164
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,199
Think carefully.

165
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,759
I'm weary.

166
00:08:34,959 --> 00:08:35,959
I'll take my leave.

167
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:51,399
I won't let you hurt Yunlie.

168
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,480
Hurt him?

169
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,639
Why would I hurt him?

170
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,840
He's my son now.

171
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,000
As long as you obey me

172
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,200
and behave yourself,

173
00:09:08,700 --> 00:09:10,700
I won't lay a hand on him.

174
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,159
I just gave Xi Yuan my word.

175
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:21,440
But Father always follows through.

176
00:09:22,799 --> 00:09:24,759
If he really sends word to Huangyan,

177
00:09:25,679 --> 00:09:27,399
what will become of Xi Yuan?

178
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:30,639
Your Highness.

179
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,559
For duty and for your own sake,

180
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:34,399
you shouldn't defy His Majesty.

181
00:09:38,039 --> 00:09:38,480
Your Highness!

182
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,600
His Highness's old injury flared up!

183
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,639
Take him to Frostveil Pool!

184
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,440
His Highness absorbed too much

185
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,799
Demonic Energy while suppressing him.

186
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,320
It's surging out now.

187
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,840
I can't keep it contained.

188
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:24,840
Hold on.

189
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,240
No.

190
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:28,360
Don't.

191
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:29,879
Stop.

192
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:38,480
Jin Yunlie.

193
00:10:43,600 --> 00:10:44,159
How strange.

194
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,679
Why would I dream about him?

195
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,399
It's burning up.

196
00:10:55,759 --> 00:10:56,440
Oh no.

197
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:59,759
Could something have happened to him?

198
00:11:00,519 --> 00:11:01,759
I need to go check on him.

199
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,440
Leave here!

200
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,679
Your Highness.

201
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:17,519
Don't let the Demonic Energy
control you!

202
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,919
Jin Yunlie.

203
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,639
What's wrong?

204
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,120
No.

205
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,799
No!

206
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,120
Jin Yunlie.

207
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,120
Wake up!

208
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:39,960
You're okay now.

209
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,519
Xi Yuan.

210
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,320
You saved me again.

211
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,519
What I just saw...

212
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,840
Was it a vision from the Symbiotic Bond?

213
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,000
Go to hell!

214
00:13:00,990 --> 00:13:04,224
♪I'm afraid the snow will melt♪

215
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:10,240
♪The reeds will fade,
and reunion may bring longing♪

216
00:13:10,528 --> 00:13:16,040
♪Green buds wither.
Does my old love still wait?♪

217
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:21,040
♪When deadwood blooms,
the world turns beautiful♪

218
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:27,024
♪I'm afraid the snow will melt♪

219
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:33,024
♪Before sunset,
it vanishes beneath the eaves♪

220
00:13:33,260 --> 00:13:38,096
♪I fear this longing
will turn my hair white♪

221
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:44,080
♪Your tears can defeat
an army of thousands♪

222
00:13:47,919 --> 00:13:48,960
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

223
00:13:50,399 --> 00:13:52,039
Xi Yuan helped me purge
the Demonic Energy.

224
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:54,080
Keep her safe.

225
00:13:54,639 --> 00:13:55,840
Don't let anything happen to her.

226
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,279
Yes.

227
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,480
Guard Miss Xi Yuan carefully.

228
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,960
No one except His Highness

229
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,320
may enter.

230
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,039
Yes.

231
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:39,472
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

232
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:46,576
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

233
00:14:47,344 --> 00:14:53,120
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

234
00:14:53,120 --> 00:15:00,048
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
